WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.800
Tags label text, and line breaks in the code do not show

2
00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:08.230
A tag is a label. &lt;h1&gt; labels the main heading.

3
00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:12.680
&lt;p&gt; opens a paragraph and &lt;/p&gt; closes it.

4
00:00:14.105 --> 00:00:17.405
Two lines in the code, but one line on the page.

5
00:00:18.281 --> 00:00:20.781
A new paragraph needs its own &lt;p&gt;.
